    "body": "Created under President Barack Obama, the FAST-41 program coordinates federal permitting reviews. Graphic by James Alafriz\nPosted By: Blair McBride November 9, 2026\nThe graphic tracks what comes next for 10 U.S. mining projects covered by FAST-41, which coordinates federal reviews and sets permitting timetables. Democrats’ midterm victory gives them more say in negotiations over broader permitting reform as those projects move towards investment decisions and production. Select a marker on the interactive map to see the project’s current stage and next milestone.\nPrint\nCOMMODITY: Battery metals Gold graphite Silver Uranium Zinc and Lead\nREGION: United States\nCOMPANY: Equinox Gold Graphite One Liberty Gold NovaGold Resources South32 Titan Mining Westwater Resources\nRepublish this article",
